  "contract": "Greater Gift of Fervor (572630) reads 'Places an Oath on all raid and party members, increasing total stats by 10%'. CoA Greater class buffs have a single rank at level 50-60, so the native aura scaling rule dropped every party member more than ten levels below it. Live combat logs (2026-08-03, Razorfen Kraul) show Greater Spider Pheromones (680312) from a level 58 caster landing on party members whose own spells top out at levels 20-30. A cast must put the aura on the caster and on every nearby party member whatever their level; Greater Power Module (680315) follows the same rule.",
